== Trivia ==
* Despite '''Paul''' stating that he "took an arrow to the elbow", there's no bandage or wound there. This is a reference to ''The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim''.
* '''Paul{{'}}'''s "I yearn for the dungeons" dialogue could potentially be a reference to ''A Minecraft Movie'', in which Steve states that "As a child, [he] yearned for the mines".
* When the {{AN|EZPZ}} perk is active, an {{Gold|S+}} [[Catacombs]] [[The Catacombs - Floor VI|F6]] or [[The Catacombs - Floor VII|F7]] run may have a maximum of 9 deaths (10 if the player who dies first has a {{Legendary}} {{Item|Spirit Pet}}).
* '''Paul{{'}}'''s line "You merely adopted the Dungeons, I was born in them, molded by them." is spoken in parallel with {{MobSprite|Necron}}'s line "{{Red|YOU MERELY ADOPTED THE CATACOMBS, I WAS MOLDED BY THEM!}}", both of which are a reference to a line in  ''The Dark Knight Rises'' spoken by [https://www.dc.com/characters/bane Bane] ''"Oh, you think darkness is your ally. You merely adopted the dark; I was born in it, moulded by it. I didn't see the light until I was already a man, by then it was nothing to me but BLINDING!"''.
* On June 3, 2024, when what would become [https://hypixel.net/threads/hypixel-skyblock-patch-notes-0-20-3-better-mayors.5692280/ 0.20.3 — Better Mayors update] first made it on [[Alpha Hypixel Network]], the following has been said: "You didn't hear this from me but apparently Aatrox and '''Paul''' failed to hand in their new campaign plans in enough time. (...), and Paul had no Abiphone Cell Service while running M4 (which sounds like the least of his problems)."<ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/hypixel-skyblock-patch-notes-0-20-3-better-mayors.5692280/</ref>
** No news about their 4th perks have been revealed since.
